
# 🐶 Random Dog Image Generator Using Python

A fun and interactive Random Dog Image Generator built using Python and Streamlit.

This application uses the Dog CEO API to fetch random dog pictures. Users can generate random dog images, select specific dog breeds, and download their favourite dog pictures.

## 🚀 Features

- Generate random dog images.
- Browse different dog breeds.
- Select specific dog breeds.
- Select dog sub-breeds.
- Display dog pictures in the application.
- Download dog images.
- Simple and interactive user interface.
- Handle API errors and connection timeouts.
- No API key required.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Streamlit
- Requests
- Dog CEO API

## 🌐 API Used

**Dog CEO API**

API website:

https://dog.ceo/dog-api/

API documentation:

https://dog.ceo/dog-api/documentation/

No API key is required.

